# Command to run appium-doctor
# appium driver doctor uiautomator2
# appium driver doctor xcuites 

# Command to set up the bundletool.jar
# chmod +x bundletool.jar

# Command to install the reporter pluggins, can be found at https://webdriver.io/docs/allure-reporter
# npm install @wdio/allure-reporter --save-dev
#
# to see the results on a server
# npx allure serve
# or This will generate a report (by default in ./allure-report), and open it in your browser.
# allure generate [allure_output_dir] && allure open

Install Xcode and run a simulator
run appium using command "appium" in terminal
Configure the simulator in appium inspector and run it (inspector used to get the path's elements)

Need to have xcuitest appium driver installed
- to check 
appium driver list

- to install
appium  driver install xcuitest

- to update brew
brew update

- to update node
brew upgrade node

- To run the project 
